    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>teniikü</uighur>
      <definition>v.i. To become smooth or even (of wrinkles). To set one's mind at rest.</definition>
      <page>941</page>
